BoilerSaver build-hook regression tests

From the ConfigurationsManager repository root:

    python -m unittest discover -s examples/BoilerSaver/test -p "test_*.py"

The three host-side tests use explicitly marked [MOCKED!] CM hooks. They verify
that only the selected package/source hook runs, that the declared original
symlink source is honored, and that missing input fails closed. They do not
upload firmware or validate hardware behavior.
